gix.net/9bf8e362/uploads/origins/21fb962d-ff3c-4dba-8945-b51a95789c37?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=128b3c3708086d768add0c28696f809b, https://si.imgix.net/9bf8e362/uploads/origins/21fb962d-ff3c-4dba-8945-b51a95789c37?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=28a7bf62b8f267b2376c95d45255fe67 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9bf8e362/uploads/origins/21fb962d-ff3c-4dba-8945-b51a95789c37?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=25619ad7b5e8ed1966f1c28c4d688015 3x"}, "body": "你好！很高兴再次见到你！\n\n非常感谢你之前提供的公狐狸插图！\n\n我想再要一幅狐狸公仔的插图。\n\n我可以要求为穿着清洁工或厨房女佣制服的男狐狸插图吗？或许可以戴头巾？\n\n赤壁狐狸的主人把赤壁狐狸当作宠物，而不是伙伴。\n\n背景是蓝带狐狸会给赤壁狐狸穿上衣服，以换取更多的食物。\n\n赤壁狐参考资料。\n\n赤壁狐狸\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1n918v_IQ6Olf7cIcufvXbxK4r2Kgw6eC/view?usp=drivesdk\n\n赤壁狐狸和主人。\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1ntzakB4HyQAfecayZQc2tuCkNPWdEcPP/view?usp=drivesdk\n\n赤壁狐狸精和主人。\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1bfTZWQQCL-iQNcjUAODaVyBz6J3xumgC/view?usp=drivesdk\n\n赤壁狐人\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/111rnL_gjH2-6vEuo0PIgF-TuRr7Vu96-/view?usp=drivesdk\n\n什么都可以。我把所有细节都留给你。\n\n非常感谢您的阅读！", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@Okari_001/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3536449, "client_id": 199253, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/85a66444/uploads/origins/88c734d4-891e-4f16-afde-daaa72e531c3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f8d413b19a2042e718c160bc731516b7", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/85a66444/uploads/origins/88c734d4-891e-4f16-afde-daaa72e531c3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f8d413b19a2042e718c160bc731516b7, https://si.imgix.net/85a66444/uploads/origins/88c734d4-891e-4f16-afde-daaa72e531c3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompres